# Beat clock (NEXT-8): Kit.BeatClock follows the looping Hum through AudioSource.PlaybackSeconds;
# BeatProbe.cs reports beats firing in order across the loop, in step with the mixer.
#   ./.build/Editor_Debug/Havana --scene Assets/Scenes/Tests/BeatClockTest.lvl --editor-exec Assets/Scenes/Tests/BeatClockFlows.edscript
wait 20
play
assert-playing 1
wait-log BeatProbe: ok | 1800
stop
